{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24161","headline":"送陈许高仆射赴镇 · 白居易","name":"送陈许高仆射赴镇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敦诗说礼中军师，重士轻财大丈夫。\n常与师徒同苦乐，不教亲故隔荣枯。\n花钿坐绕黄金印，丝管行随白玉壶。\n商皓老狂唯爱醉，时时能寄酒钱无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}